# The memory sidecar's build context (docker/memory/Dockerfile). BuildKit reads
# this file in preference to the root .dockerignore. Admits only what the image
# copies; everything else in the checkout stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!extensions
!scripts
!config.example.toml
!docker/memory/entrypoint.sh
**/node_modules
**/.git
# The private rulebook annexes, never in an image (publish-manifest.json
# excludes them from the public tree too, so an image built from either tree
# carries the same rulebook files).
**/CLAUDE.md
